{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-18-1","title":"Matthew 18:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ warns his disciples to be humble and harmless, 7 to avoid offences, 10 and not to despise the little ones; 15 teaches how we are to deal with our brethren when they offend us, 21 and how oft to forgive them; 23 which he sets forth by a parable of the king that took account of his servants, 32 and punished him who shewed no mercy to his fellow.</p>\n<p>the same. Mr 9:33-37 Who. 20:20-28; 23:11; Mr 9:34; 10:35-45; Lu 9:46-48; 22:24-27; Ro 12:10 Php 2:3 in. 3:2; 5:19,20; 7:21; Mr 10:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-2","title":"Matthew 18:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>19:13,14; 1Ki 3:7; Jer 1:7; Mr 9:36,37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-3","title":"Matthew 18:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Verily. 5:18; 6:2,5,16; Joh 1:51; 3:3 Except. 13:15; Ps 51:10-13; 131:2; Isa 6:10; Mr 4:12; Lu 22:32; Ac 3:19 Ac 28:27; Jas 5:19,20 and become. Mr 10:14,15; Lu 18:16,17; 1Co 14:20; 1Pe 2:2 enter. 5:20; 19:23; Lu 13:24; Joh 3:5; Ac 14:22; 2Pe 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-4","title":"Matthew 18:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>humble. 23:11,12; Ps 131:1,2; Isa 57:15; Lu 14:11; 1Pe 5:5; Jas 4:10 greatest. 1; 20:26,27; Mr 10:43; Lu 9:48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-5","title":"Matthew 18:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>receive. 10:40-42; 25:40,45; Mr 9:41; Lu 9:48; 17:1,2 receiveth. Mr 9:37; Joh 13:20; Ga 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-6","title":"Matthew 18:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>offend. Ps 105:15; Zec 2:8; Mr 9:42; Lu 17:1,2; Ac 9:5; Ro 14:13-15,21 Ro 15:1-3; 1Co 8:9-13; 10:32,33; 2Th 1:6-9 little. 10,14; Zec 13:7; Lu 17:2 that a.This mode of punishment appears to have obtained in Syria as well as in Greece, especially in cases of parricide. That it was customary in Greece we learn from Suidas, in [hyperbolon lithon,] and the scholiast on the Equites of Aristophanes: [Hotan gar katara tinos baros apo ton trachelos kremannumi .] \"When a person was drowned, they hung a weight about his neck.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-7","title":"Matthew 18:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>unto. Ge 13:7; 1Sa 2:17,22-25; 2Sa 12:14; Lu 17:1; Ro 2:23,24 1Ti 5:14,15; 6:1; Tit 2:5,8; 2Pe 2:2 for. Mr 13:7; Ac 1:16; 1Co 11:19; 2Th 2:3-12; 1Ti 4:1-3; 2Ti 3:1-5 2Ti 4:3,4; Jude 1:4 but. 13:41,42; 23:13-28; 26:24; Joh 17:12; Ac 1:18-20; 2Pe 2:3,15-17 Jude 1:11-13; Re 2:14,15,20-23; 19:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-8","title":"Matthew 18:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>if. 5:29,30; 14:3,4; De 13:6-8; Mr 9:43-48; Lu 14:26,27,33; 18:22,23 and cast. Isa 2:20,21; 30:22; Eze 18:31; Ro 13:12; Php 3:8,9 maimed. 15:30,31 everlasting. 25:41,46; Isa 33:14; Mr 9:48,49; Lu 16:24; 2Th 1:8,9; Re 14:10 Re 20:15; 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-9","title":"Matthew 18:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>to enter. 19:17,23,24; Ac 14:22; Heb 4:11; Re 21:27 rather. 16:26; Lu 9:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-10","title":"Matthew 18:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>heed. 6,14; 12:20; Ps 15:4; Zec 4:10; Lu 10:16; Ro 14:1-3,10,13-15,21 Ro 15:1; 1Co 8:8-13; 9:22; 11:22; 16:11; 2Co 10:1,10; Ga 4:13,14; 6:1 1Th 4:8; 1Ti 4:12 their. 1:20; 2:13,19; 24:31; Ge 32:1,2; 2Ki 6:16,17; Ps 34:7; 91:11 Zec 13:7; Lu 16:22; Ac 5:19; 10:3; 12:7-11,23; 27:23; Heb 1:14 behold. 2Sa 14:28; 1Ki 22:19; Es 1:14; Ps 17:15; Lu 1:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-11","title":"Matthew 18:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>9:12,13; 10:6; 15:24; Lu 9:56; 15:24,32; 19:10; Joh 3:17; 10:10 Joh 12:47; 1Ti 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-12","title":"Matthew 18:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>How. 21:28; 22:42; 1Co 10:15 if. 12:11; Ps 119:176; Isa 53:6; Jer 50:6; Eze 34:16,28; Lu 15:4-7 Joh 10:11-21; 1Pe 2:25 into. 1Ki 21:17; Eze 34:6,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-13","title":"Matthew 18:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>he rejoiceth. Ps 147:11; Isa 53:11; 62:5; Jer 32:37-41; Mic 7:18; Zep 3:17 Lu 15:5-10,23,24; Joh 4:34-36; Jas 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-14","title":"Matthew 18:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>it is. Lu 12:32; Joh 6:39,40; 10:27-30; 17:12; Ro 8:28-39; Eph 1:5-7 1Pe 1:3-5 your. 5:16; 6:9,32 one. Isa 40:11; Zec 13:7; Joh 21:15; 1Co 8:11-13; 2Ti 2:10; Heb 12:13 2Pe 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-15","title":"Matthew 18:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>if. 35; Le 6:2-7; Lu 17:3,4; 1Co 6:6-8; 8:12; 2Co 7:12; Col 3:13 1Th 4:6 go. Le 19:17; Ps 141:5; Pr 25:9,10 thou hast. Pr 11:30; Ro 12:21; 1Co 9:19-21; Jas 5:19,20; 1Pe 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-16","title":"Matthew 18:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>that in. Nu 35:30; De 17:6; 19:15; 1Ki 21:13; Joh 8:17; 2Co 13:1; 1Ti 5:19 Heb 10:28; 1Jo 5:7,8; Re 11:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-17","title":"Matthew 18:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>tell. Ac 6:1-3; 15:6,7; 1Co 5:4,5; 6:1-4; 2Co 2:6,7; 3Jo 1:9,10 let. Ro 16:17,18; 1Co 5:3-5,9-13; 2Th 3:6,14,15; 1Ti 6:5; 2Jo 1:10,11 an heathen. 6:7; Ezr 6:21; Eze 11:12; 2Co 6:14-17; Eph 4:17-19; 5:11,12 a publican. 5:46; 11:19; 21:31,32; Lu 15:1; 18:11; 19:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-18","title":"Matthew 18:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>16:19; Joh 20:23; Ac 15:23-31; 1Co 5:4,5; 2Co 2:10; Re 3:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-19","title":"Matthew 18:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>That if. 5:24; 21:22; Mr 11:24; Joh 15:7,16; Ac 1:14; 2:1,2; 4:24-31; 6:4 Ac 12:5; Eph 6:18-20; Php 1:19; Jas 5:14-16; 1Jo 3:22; 5:14-16 Re 11:4-6 it shall. Joh 14:13,14; 16:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-20","title":"Matthew 18:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>two. Ge 49:10; Joh 20:19,26; 1Co 5:4; 1Th 1:1; Phm 1:2 there. 28:20; Ex 20:24; Zec 2:5; Joh 8:58; Re 1:11-13; 2:1; 21:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-21","title":"Matthew 18:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>till. 15; Lu 17:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-22","title":"Matthew 18:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>but. 6:11,12,14,15; Isa 55:7; Mic 7:19; Mr 11:25,26; Ro 12:21 Eph 4:26,31,32; 5:1; Col 3:13; 1Ti 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-23","title":"Matthew 18:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>is. 3:2; 13:24,31,33,44,45,47,52; 25:1,14 which. 25:19-30; Lu 16:1,2; 19:12-27; Ro 14:12; 1Co 4:5; 2Co 5:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-24","title":"Matthew 18:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>owed. Lu 7:41,42; 13:4; *marg: Lu 16:5,7 ten thousand.[Murias talanton ,] a myriad of talents, the highest number known in Greek arithmetical notation. According to Prideaux, the Roman talent was equal to 216�; ten thousand of which would amount to 2,160,000�. If the Jewish talent of silver be designed, which is estimated by the same learned writer at 450�., this sum amounts to 4,500,000�.; but if the gold talent is meant, which is equal to 7200�., then the amount is 72,000,000�. This immense sum represents our boundless obligations to God, and our utter incapacity, as sinners infinitely indebted to Divine justice, of paying one mite out of the talent.</p>\n<p>1Ch 29:7; Ezr 9:6; Ps 38:4; 40:12; 130:3,4 talents.\"A talent is 750 ounces of silver, which after five shillings the ounce is 187�. 10s.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-25","title":"Matthew 18:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>commanded. Le 25:39; 2Ki 4:1; Ne 5:5,8; Isa 50:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-26","title":"Matthew 18:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>worshipped him. or, besought him. have. 29; Lu 7:43; Ro 10:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-27","title":"Matthew 18:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>moved. Jud 10:16; Ne 9:17; Ps 78:38; 86:5,15; 145:8; Ho 11:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-28","title":"Matthew 18:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>an hundred.Rather, \"a hundred denarii,\" as our penny does not convey one seventh of the meaning. This would amount to about 3�. 2s. 6d. English; which was not one six hundred thousandth part of the 10,000 talents, even calculating them as Roman talents.</p>\n<p>pence.\"The Roman penny is the eighth part of an ounce, which after five shillings the ounce is sevenpence halfpenny.\"</p>\n<p>20:2 and took. De 15:2; Ne 5:7,10,11; 10:31; Isa 58:3; Eze 45:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-29","title":"Matthew 18:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Have. 26; 6:12; Phm 1:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-30","title":"Matthew 18:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>but. 1Ki 21:27-29; 22:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-31","title":"Matthew 18:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>they. Ps 119:136,158; Jer 9:1; Mr 3:5; Lu 19:41; Ro 9:1-3; 12:15 2Co 11:21; Heb 13:3 and came. Ge 37:2; Lu 14:21; Heb 13:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-32","title":"Matthew 18:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>O thou. 25:26; Lu 19:22; Ro 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-33","title":"Matthew 18:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>even. 5:44,45; Lu 6:35,36; Eph 4:32; 5:1,2; Col 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-34","title":"Matthew 18:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>and delivered. 5:25,26; Lu 12:58,59; 2Th 1:8,9; Re 14:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-18-35","title":"Matthew 18:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>do. 6:12,14,15; 7:1,2; Pr 21:13; Mr 11:26; Lu 6:37,38; Jas 2:13 from. Pr 21:2; Jer 3:10; Zec 7:12; Lu 16:15; Jas 3:14; 4:8; Re 2:23</p>"}]}